## Cursor adaptation

Luna maps to Composer 2.5 standard, Terra to Claude Sonnet 5 and Sol to Claude Opus 5 high. These are framework routing choices, not benchmark equivalences. Select the principal explicitly in Cursor; this policy cannot change its model automatically. If the actual model or required capability is unavailable or unknown, report it and resolve before critical mutation. Do not silently downgrade a risk floor. Check runtime model evidence because platform restrictions may cause fallback. Skills are optional and are not bundled here. Use the native Task tool when available; never simulate delegation or count configured roles as executions.
